  "scope_notes": "Diff not provided in input; metadata shows a small change (+52/-0 across 2 files) containing validation handling and a functional test in `feature_assumeutxo.py`.",
  "changed_since_previous": "",
  "card": "During assumeutxo snapshot loading, `ActivateSnapshot` verifies an empty mempool before releasing `cs_main` to populate the snapshot chainstate. If any transaction enters the mempool during the population phase, `AddChainstate` triggers an assertion failure that crashes `bitcoind` and corrupts startup state such that the node requires `-reindex`. This change rechecks the mempool after re-acquiring `cs_main` and routes through `cleanup_bad_snapshot` if transactions are present. It also adds a functional test reproducing the race condition.",
